From cc389d45d10e15f94974091d7c0add6b66911026 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 16:38:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Rename the app to OrreLink, with a colosseum icon

Display strings and launcher art only. The Android application ID, the signing
key, the XDNetplay code namespaces and the file layout all stay exactly as they
are: the ID and signature are what let 1.0.0 users update in place, and the
namespaces are not something any user ever sees.

The icon is an Orre colosseum in desert sandstone -- adaptive foreground,
themed-icon monochrome, and the legacy mipmaps, all drawn from the same
geometry so they cannot drift apart.
---
